		{"id":"node-mobile-companion","type":"text","text":"## Mobile Companion App (PWA)\n\n* **Location**: `software/mobile/`\n* **Tech**: PWA (Installable on Android & iOS)\n* **Board Navigation**: Words With Friends pinch-to-zoom & pan\n* **Sync Model**: Fixed Board ID (`SCB-8492`) + Paired Friends\n* **Pacing**: Async correspondence (multi-hour / multi-day)\n* **Emotional UX**: 5–10s audio voice notes & board TTS cheers\n* **Game Referee**: C engine via WebAssembly (`engine.wasm`)\n* **Backend**: Firebase Firestore & Auth + local mock fallback\n* **Physical Board Sync**: Auto RFID detection with visual LCD guide","x":6400,"y":-2800,"width":1600,"height":700,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"102a3e5c110a1c00","type":"file","file":"Potential_Issues.md","x":2560,"y":-2880,"width":1240,"height":1600,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-comp-table","type":"file","file":"Component_Candidate_Comparison.md","x":-3480,"y":2000,"width":1540,"height":1840},
