		{"id":"node-hw-3d-render","type":"file","file":"hardware/kicad/test_grid_4x4/test_grid_4x4_3d_iso.png","x":2540,"y":-40,"width":1007,"height":560,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-rfid-schem","type":"file","file":"RFID_Multiplexing_and_Coil_Schematics.md","x":3640,"y":0,"width":1020,"height":2920,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-hall-eval","type":"file","file":"Hall_Effect_vs_RFID_Evaluation.md","x":4880,"y":40,"width":1020,"height":2080,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-cad-lessons","type":"file","file":"hardware/cad/cad_lessons.md","x":8360,"y":1745,"width":1040,"height":1210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-cad-readme","type":"file","file":"hardware/cad/README.md","x":8360,"y":-40,"width":840,"height":1700,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-cad-assembly-notes","type":"text","text":"## 4x4 Master 3D Assembly\n\n* **Base Tray**: Houses PCB with 3.5mm standoffs\n* **PCB Mockup**: 100x100mm 4-layer NFC board\n* **Top Grid Plate**: 1.5mm RF floor + 1.2mm ribs\n* **Tiles**: 16 NFC Scrabble tiles with NTAG213\n* **Fasteners**: 4x M3 screws (90mm pitch)\n* **Openings**: J1 (Host), J2 (NFC), J3 (SMA)","x":9520,"y":1210,"width":1400,"height":450,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-cad-render-assembly","type":"file","file":"hardware/cad/output/assembly_4x4_prototype_3d.png","x":9480,"y":60,"width":1400,"height":1050,"color":"1"},
